## Independent review round (reviewer task agent FixReview, read-only)
3 findings, all fixed with regressions (see FIX_HANDOFF.md "Independent review round"):
  1. save/load still wrote/read files in the frame callback -> moved to workers
     (RED/GREEN: crates/ui/tests/import_and_async.rs::save_and_load_run_on_workers,
      a_load_completed_after_the_game_changed_is_discarded)
  2. worker polling stopped once the game ended (tick_ai early return) -> poll +
     repaint moved into the always-running frame body
  3. --smoke --decider could still call the model during capture frames -> the
     decider is now disabled for the whole smoke run (noted on stderr)
Noted as intended, not a defect: the import URL guard still accepts an explicit
:443 (https default; the blocker asked to restrict ports, and :8443 etc. stay
rejected).
  cmd: aperture.exe --smoke <tmp>.png --decider
       -> "smoke mode: Decider-2B calls are disabled for the capture"; run took 1.7s
          (no model traffic during the capture)
